      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FLYING DUCATI (1) is progressing well and looks close to another win after hitting the frame last run (25.94) at this track. Has never been out of the money in three starts this course and distance. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and three minor placings to his credit. Key chance in this line up. TRIPPED OUT (6) was well fancied last time and led throughout to score (25.79) at this track in a Special conditions H over 460m. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings three times from four attempts. Has hit winning form and can measure up again. RUNWAY BLUE (2) had the drop on the lead and went on to be beaten 2.5 lengths into second (25.98) at this track in a Special conditions H over 460m. Goes very well from this draw with two wins and two minor placings from four starts. Can feature again. ELLIS UNIT ONE (7) racing over this course and distance brings the best out in him.",
